docs/codex-collaboration/sprint-ingest-prompt.md:103:**Race safety with the daemon.** The daemon ingests from `raw/Manual Fetch Kimi/`, `raw/Papers Cube Manual Fetch/`, `raw/Manual Resourcing/`, and `raw/Manual Fetch Discovery/`. Codex ingests from `raw/manual-fetch/seasonal-geographic-variance/auto-fetched/`. Different folders → no overlap → no race. The tracker check is a belt-and-suspenders safety for the case where someone (Codex or the daemon) gets pointed at the wrong folder by accident.
docs/codex-collaboration/sprint-ingest-prompt.md:109:**Self-documenting per fire.** Each fire's `codex-runs/*.md` report is the proof of work. Karen reads only the headline (FIRE COMPLETE / ESCALATED / STOPPED EARLY) when scanning.
