docs/codex-collaboration/sprint-ingest-prompt.md:121:If velocity flatlines for >2 hours: check `data/evidence/autonomy/daemon-runs/` latest tick log for `FAIL:` lines, and check `data/evidence/codex-runs/` latest report for the stop reason.
